title: "Molecular Tissue Fingerprints: a 20-gene panel, its conformal guarantee, and what a within-study fingerprint can identify"
type: software
version: "2.1.1"
date-released: 2026-09-27
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Stanford-Bioinformatics-Center/multiomics-hackathon-2026-track-3"
repository: "https://github.com/CoryGardner/motrpac_challenge"   # public mirror
